{"version":1,"content":"<p>烏克蘭總統沃洛迪米爾·澤連斯基在社交平台發文稱，烏軍已連續數日記錄到星盾在烏克蘭各地及被佔領地區出現重大運行幹擾。澤連斯基稱，星盾正被系統性施加每小時100英裏、即161公裏的速度限制。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586076.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.008096+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:13:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_hash":"9ef2a3ba6a572b9f7a94f444b07a645f4e2d96ed5f2c9324a2c447d303d18756","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}